# Project: Joint CPD Studio
## Stack
- Next.js 15 App Router (Server Components by default)
- TypeScript (strict mode)
- Supabase (PostgreSQL, Auth, RLS)
- Stripe (Subscriptions & Connect for creator payouts)
- shadcn/ui + Tailwind CSS

## Core Domain Concepts
- **User Roles:** `learner`, `creator` (a creator can also be a learner).
- **Course:** Can be a `solo` course or a `joint` course (requires 2+ creators).
- **GOsC Compliance:** Every course must track "Learning with Others" hours and produce a verifiable certificate.
- **Marketplace:** Creators list courses; learners enroll. Platform takes a transaction fee.
